    {
      "source": "The default implementation writes a debug log message with key and source.\nAs of 4.3.3, this does not log the value anymore in order to avoid accidental\nlogging of sensitive settings. Subclasses may override this method to change\nthe log level and/or log message, including the property's value if desired.",
      "translation": "默认实现会写入包含键和来源的调试日志消息。从 4.3.3 版本开始，为了避免意外记录敏感设置，该实现不再记录值。子类可以重写此方法来更改日志级别和/或日志消息，包括（如需要）属性值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
